Description: Copy-on-write Btrfs development environments, Docker-free
 Slipfork builds and runs a project's images, databases, caches, and workers
 from one Forkfile on native Btrfs subvolumes and crun, behind one .localhost
 domain. Forks clone code, dependencies, and live data in milliseconds.
